          spread S   sets  median k   90th   max k  max k / S
  8^0 .. 8^1 (     1-8      )   3373         0      0       2      0.261
  8^1 .. 8^2 (     8-64     )   2307         1      2       8      0.130
  8^2 .. 8^3 (    64-512    )    286         2      6      14      0.058
